<ProseLayout title="About" description="About Gary Ritchie.">
  <p>
    I've been playing with computers since the early 1980s, starting with a TRS-80 Color Computer
    with 4K of RAM where I taught myself to program in BASIC and 6809 assembly language.
  </p>
  <p>
    My first paid software job was in 1989, and I've been working as a developer ever since, with an
    almost 20-year stint at Microsoft, a brief time at Apple, and almost 10 years at Posit (formerly
    RStudio), where I am still working.
  </p>
  <p>More to come...</p>
  <p>
    If you want to reach me, <a href="mailto:kitty.dwell3q@icloud.com">email works</a>. I'm also on <ExternalLink
      href="https://github.com/gtritchie"
      rel="me">GitHub</ExternalLink
    >.
  </p>
</ProseLayout>
